 "footnotes": [
  {
   "id": "footnote-1",
   "kind": "book",
   "number": "1",
   "html": "<span data-concept=\"open-system\">热库</span>的带宽与<span data-concept=\"correlation-time\">关联时间</span>之间的这种关系常常成立，但并非总是成立。例如，如果系统由空间范围$L$大于光学波长$\\lambda_0$的原子系综构成，而<span data-concept=\"open-system\">环境</span>由电磁场构成，则<span data-concept=\"correlation-time\">关联时间</span>$\\ktauc \\sim L/c$对应于光子离开介质所需的时间，因为一个原子释放的光子可以在时间$\\ktauc$之后被另一个原子吸收。"
  },
  {
   "id": "footnote-2",
   "kind": "book",
   "number": "2",
   "html": "<span data-concept=\"born-markov-approximation\">玻恩近似</span>实际上比这个略强。它指出，就计算系统动力学而言，<span data-concept=\"open-system\">热库</span>大到使可因子化的假设在所有时刻都成立。"
  },
  {
   "id": "c-eq-3-33",
   "kind": "correction",
   "html": "书中在指数里印的是$+i$。$\\kHSR = \\hbar\\kft(\\kt)\\hat{S}_z$的演化算符是$\\hat{U} = e^{-i\\int_0^{\\kt}\\kft(\\kt')d\\kt'\\hat{S}_z}$，因为不同时刻的$\\kHSR$与自身对易；用它得到$\\hat{U}^\\dagger\\hat{S}_+\\hat{U} = e^{i\\int_0^{\\kt}\\kft(\\kt')d\\kt'}\\hat{S}_+$，即式 (3.34) 的相位。"
  }
 ],
 "derivations": [
  {
   "id": "density-operator-evolution",
   "what": "密度算符的运动方程",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，3.3 系统-热库相互作用",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "text": "混合的概率$p_\\alpha$不随时间变化。",
       "src": "(3.1)"
      },
      {
       "tex": "i\\hbar|\\dot{\\kpsi}_\\alpha^S\\rangle = \\kHS|\\kpsi_\\alpha^S\\rangle",
       "src": "(1.11)"
      },
      {
       "text": "薛定谔方程的共轭，$-i\\hbar\\langle\\dot{\\kpsi}_\\alpha^S| = \\langle\\kpsi_\\alpha^S|\\kHS$，因为$\\kHS$是厄米的。",
       "src": "(1.11), (1.5)"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\sum_\\alpha p_\\alpha|\\kpsi_\\alpha^S\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi_\\alpha^S|}",
      "src": "(3.1)",
      "uses": []
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\hbar\\dot{\\krhoS}} = \\mk{R}{\\sum_\\alpha p_\\alpha(i\\hbar|\\dot{\\kpsi}_\\alpha^S\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi_\\alpha^S| + |\\kpsi_\\alpha^S\\rangle\\,i\\hbar\\langle\\dot{\\kpsi}_\\alpha^S|)}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ],
       "cap": "按乘积法则求导，再乘以$i\\hbar$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\hbar\\dot{\\krhoS}} = \\mk{R}{\\sum_\\alpha p_\\alpha(\\kHS|\\kpsi_\\alpha^S\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi_\\alpha^S| - |\\kpsi_\\alpha^S\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi_\\alpha^S|\\kHS)}",
       "uses": [
        1,
        2
       ]
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{i\\hbar\\dot{\\krhoS}} = \\mk{R}{\\kHS\\krhoS - \\krhoS\\kHS}",
       "uses": []
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\dot{\\krhoS}} = \\mk{R}{\\frac{1}{i\\hbar}[\\kHS, \\krhoS]}",
       "uses": []
      }
     ],
     "num": "(3.23)",
     "note": "书中把$\\frac{1}{i\\hbar}[\\kHS, \\krhoS]$印成等于式 (3.22) 的$i\\hbar\\dot{\\krhoS}$；因子$\\frac{1}{i\\hbar}$属于$\\dot{\\krhoS}$，即式 (3.28) 的形式。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "decaying-atom-density-matrix",
   "what": "衰变原子的约化密度矩阵",
   "source": "现代原子与光学物理 II，3.3 系统-热库相互作用",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "assumes": [
      {
       "tex": "|\\kpsi(\\kt)\\rangle = \\kcone|1\\rangle \\otimes |0\\rangle + \\kctwo(\\kt)|2\\rangle \\otimes |0\\rangle + \\sum_k \\kck(\\kt)|1\\rangle \\otimes |1_k\\rangle",
       "src": "3.3"
      },
      {
       "text": "在以原子频率$\\komega$转动的参考系中，激发态的概率幅按$\\kctwo(\\kt) = \\kctwo e^{-\\kgamma\\kt/2}$衰变。",
       "src": "(2.90)"
      },
      {
       "text": "概率守恒：$|\\kcone|^2 + |\\kctwo(\\kt)|^2 + \\sum_k|\\kck(\\kt)|^2 = 1$。",
       "src": "2.3.4"
      },
      {
       "text": "对初始的纯态，密度矩阵有$\\rho_{ij}(0) = c_i c_j^*$。",
       "src": "3.1"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\mathrm{Tr}_R[|\\kpsi(\\kt)\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi(\\kt)|]}",
      "src": "(3.21)",
      "uses": []
     },
     "steps": [
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\sum_{n=0}^\\infty\\sum_k\\langle n_k|\\kpsi(\\kt)\\rangle\\langle\\kpsi(\\kt)|n_k\\rangle}",
       "uses": [],
       "cap": "对场取阵迹，遍及每个模$k$的$n$光子福克态$|n_k\\rangle$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\Big(|\\kcone|^2 + \\sum_k|\\kck(\\kt)|^2\\Big)|1\\rangle\\langle 1| + |\\kctwo(\\kt)|^2|2\\rangle\\langle 2| + \\kcone\\kctwo(\\kt)^*|1\\rangle\\langle 2| + \\kctwo(\\kt)\\kcone^*|2\\rangle\\langle 1|}",
       "uses": [
        0
       ],
       "cap": "只有$\\langle 0|$遇到不含光子的部分，只有$\\langle 1_k|$遇到$c_k(t)|1\\rangle \\otimes |1_k\\rangle$。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\begin{pmatrix} |\\kcone|^2 + \\sum_k|\\kck(\\kt)|^2 & \\kcone\\kctwo^* e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}/2} \\\\ \\kctwo\\kcone^* e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}/2} & |\\kctwo|^2 e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}} \\end{pmatrix}}",
       "uses": [
        1
       ],
       "cap": "写成基$\\{|1\\rangle, |2\\rangle\\}$中的矩阵。"
      },
      {
       "tex": "\\mk{L}{\\krhoS} = \\mk{R}{\\begin{pmatrix} 1 - \\krhotwotwo(0)e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}} & \\krhoonetwo(0)e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}/2} \\\\ \\krhotwoone(0)e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}/2} & \\krhotwotwo(0)e^{-\\kgamma {\\kt}} \\end{pmatrix}}",
       "uses": [
        2,
        3
       ]
      }
     ],
     "num": "(3.26)"
    }
   ]
  },
